                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "This file looks like it has two completely different fan boards in it, not different placement of the same board.\n\nI suspect this should've been two files."
                },
                {
                    "file": "configurations/meta/minerva_fanboard_adc_silergy.json",
                    "line": 938,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Yang Chen",
                        "email": "yang.chen@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "Quanta-YangChen"
                    },
                    "message": "It's the same fan board with a different source of component (1st/2nd), so I use two different files to distinguish them with different probe conditions and different sensor formulas."
                }
